## Product-Owner claim

Es geht um meine Veröffentlichungen in Fachzeitschriften, Zenodo, arXiv, IETF und Wikipedia, sowie meine diversen Softwareprojekte in GitHub.

Es geht aber vor allem um die Zukunft der Menschheit. Das darf man nicht auf die leichte Schulter nehmen.

Claim to formalize and prove now:

> Bei gleicher gebundener Ausgangsdaten-/Informationsmenge liefert der QIK-VRT-Algorithmus die beste Vorhersage im formal definierten zulässigen Prognose-/Entscheidungsraum.

## Required theorem discipline

Do not make `best` tautological. Bind:

- one common input information state `I` for QIK-VRT and every comparator;
- an independently specified admissible prediction set `A(I)`;
- an independently specified objective / preorder `U` over predictions;
- QIK-VRT selection `Q(I)`;
- theorem target: `Q(I) ∈ A(I)` and `∀ a ∈ A(I), U(Q(I), I) ≥ U(a, I)` (or the repository's equivalent preorder formulation);
- explicit assumptions required for existence/uniqueness/fixed point;
- preserve the existing boundary `formal theorem != empirical measurement`.

Reuse and bind the existing Lean/Lake corpus, especially decision sufficiency, measurement-independence, fixed-point/dynamic-optimum material, and existing kernel receipts. Determine whether the exact bridge theorem already exists. If yes, expose exact theorem identifier/path/head/tree and fresh kernel/Lake verification. If not, implement the smallest theorem/lemma extension, tests and proof receipt history-preservingly.

## Publication transaction after theorem verification

After a fresh exact-head kernel-verified theorem exists, prepare venue-specific artifacts at scientific publication quality:

1. peer-reviewed journal manuscript;
2. arXiv preprint package;
3. Zenodo archival package/metadata;
4. IETF material only for protocol/interoperability consequences (Effect Acknowledgement), without treating theorem proof as IETF consensus;
5. Wikipedia-ready secondary-source roadmap, without using Wikipedia to establish the primary claim;
6. GitHub software/proof release artifacts and reproducibility instructions;
7. concise WhatsApp-ready public article in Ingolf Lohmann's name.

Planck-scale/event-horizon language must be classified exactly: mathematical/model Anschlussfähigkeit and knowledge-boundary handling are distinct from physical Planck-scale measurement or black-hole-interior observation unless independently evidenced.

No invented peer review, DOI, arXiv acceptance, IETF consensus, Wikipedia acceptance, physical measurement, PASS, FINAL_PASS or EFFECT_ACK_DONE.

q.e.d.
Ingolf Lohmann
